                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00001         ********************************************************************
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00002         * gfx2 - CoCo 3 graphics subroutine module
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00003         * NOTE: NEED TO ADD SUPPORT FOR FILLED CIRCLE AND FILLED ELLIPSE
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00004         * Also, DRAW has undocumented feature of specifying starting X,Y
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00005         * coord
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00006         * Edt/Rev  YYYY/MM/DD  Modified by
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00007         * Comment
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00008         * ------------------------------------------------------------------
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00009         *   2      ????/??/??
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00010         * Original Tandy distribution version.
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00011         *
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00012         *   3      1990/08/16  Kevin Darling and Kent Meyers
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00013         * Enhanced, with bug fix (adds Multi-Vue windowing support commands, etc.
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00014         * and optimizations). Note: I changed the edition to 3 myself
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00015         * as the original was still set to 2 (same as the Tandy one).
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00016         *
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00017         *   4      2018/06/14  L. Curtis Boyle
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00018         * Commented source code, couple of minor optimizations, added FCircle & FEllipse commands
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00019         * (keeping to <=8 character function name limits of original). Also documented option X,Y start
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00020         * coord for DRAW command (not in manual)
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00021         *
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00022         *  5       2022/05/28  L. Curtis Boyle
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00023         * Changed OnMouse to check set BOTH MsSig & SSig (keypress & mouse button). Also minor
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00024         * optimizations. (Particularly DRAW statement and some 6309 stuff).
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00025         
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00026                             nam       gfx2
                      (/basic09/gfx2.asm):00027                             ttl       subroutine module
