00CE                  (            os9.d):01275         E$DirFul            RMB       1                   Module Directory Full
00CF                  (            os9.d):01276         E$MemFul            RMB       1                   Process Memory Full
00D0                  (            os9.d):01277         E$UnkSvc            RMB       1                   Unknown Service Code
00D1                  (            os9.d):01278         E$ModBsy            RMB       1                   Module Busy
