0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00037         V.ScrnA             RMB       2                   (2) screen start address in system memory
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00038         V.ScrnE             RMB       2                   (2) address of end of screen
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00039         V.CrsrA             RMB       1                   (2) cursor address
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00040         V.CrsAL             RMB       1                   cursor address low
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00041         V.CChar             RMB       1                   value of character under cursor
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00042         V.Mode              RMB       1                   mode: 0=256x192 x2, 1=128x192 x4
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00043         V.NGChr             RMB       1                   number of additional characters to get
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00044         V.RTAdd             RMB       2                   (2) return address after getting characters
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00045         V.NChar             RMB       1                   character to process
