0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00109         V.KTblLC            RMB       1                   key table entry #
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00110         V.6F                RMB       1                   ???
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00111         V.COLoad            RMB       1                   CO-module loaded flags
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00112         V.CFlag             RMB       1                   true lowercase flag $10=true, $00=false
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00113         V.GrfDrvE           RMB       2                   GrfDrv entry point
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00114         V.CoVDGE            RMB       2                   CoVDG entry point
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00115         V.CoWPE             RMB       2                   CoWP entry point
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00116         V.CoHRE             RMB       2                   CoHR entry point
0040                  (       cocovtio.d):00117         V.Co42E             RMB       2                   Co42 entry point
