0017                  (       cocovtio.d):00264         Pt.Res              RMB       1                   Resolution (0..640 by: 0=ten/1=one)
0018                  (       cocovtio.d):00265         Pt.AcX              RMB       2                   Actual X Value
001A                  (       cocovtio.d):00266         Pt.AcY              RMB       2                   Actual Y Value
001C                  (       cocovtio.d):00267         Pt.WRX              RMB       2                   Window Relative X
001E                  (       cocovtio.d):00268         Pt.WRY              RMB       2                   Window Relative Y
     0020             (       cocovtio.d):00269         Pt.Siz              EQU       .                   Packet Size 32 bytes
                      (       cocovtio.d):00270         
                      (       cocovtio.d):00271         **************************
                      (       cocovtio.d):00272         * window regions for mouse
