     0000             (       cocovtio.d):00274         WR.Cntnt            EQU       0                   content region
     0001             (       cocovtio.d):00275         WR.Cntrl            EQU       1                   control region
     0002             (       cocovtio.d):00276         WR.OfWin            EQU       2                   off window
