                      (       cocovtio.d):00840         * Window table entry structure
                      (       cocovtio.d):00841         * These tables sit in system block 0 and there is 1 for every window init'd
                      (       cocovtio.d):00842         * including any overlay windows.
     0020             (       cocovtio.d):00843         MaxWind             EQU       32                  maximum allowable window tables
