FFF3                  (       cocovtio.d):00848         Wt.LStrt            RMB       2                   screen logical start address                -$0D
FFF5                  (       cocovtio.d):00849         Wt.CPX              RMB       1                   current X coord. start                      -$0B
FFF6                  (       cocovtio.d):00850         Wt.CPY              RMB       1                   current Y coord. start                      -$0A
FFF7                  (       cocovtio.d):00851         Wt.SZX              RMB       1                   current X size (CWArea)                     -$09
FFF8                  (       cocovtio.d):00852         Wt.SZY              RMB       1                   current Y size (CWArea)                     -$08
