FFFA                  (       cocovtio.d):00854         Wt.SYFct            RMB       1                   Y scaling factor (0=no scaling)             -$06
FFFB                  (       cocovtio.d):00855         Wt.Cur              RMB       2                   cursor physical address on screen           -$05
FFFD                  (       cocovtio.d):00856         Wt.FMsk             RMB       1                   font bit mask (based from left)             -$03
FFFE                  (       cocovtio.d):00857         Wt.CurX             RMB       2                   X coord of cursor                           -$02
0000                  (       cocovtio.d):00858         Wt.CurY             RMB       2                   Y Coord of cursor                            $00
0002                  (       cocovtio.d):00859         Wt.XBCnt            RMB       1                   width of window (in bytes)                   $02
0003                  (       cocovtio.d):00860         Wt.CWTmp            RMB       1                   bytes wide each text chr (1,2,4)             $03
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00861         Wt.BRow             RMB       2                   bytes/text row (8x width in gfx)             $04
0006                  (       cocovtio.d):00862         Wt.Fore             RMB       1                   foreground palette #                         $06
