000E                  (       cocovtio.d):00869         Wt.PBlk             RMB       1                   PSet memory block #                          $0E
000F                  (       cocovtio.d):00870         Wt.POff             RMB       2                   PSet offset in block                         $0F
0011                  (       cocovtio.d):00871         Wt.OBlk             RMB       1                   Overlay memory block #                       $11
