0021                  (       cocovtio.d):00880         Wt.NBlk             RMB       1                   memory block # for next GPLoad               $21
0022                  (       cocovtio.d):00881         Wt.NOff             RMB       2                   Offset in block for next GPLoad              $22
0024                  (       cocovtio.d):00882         Wt.LStDf            RMB       2                   screen logical start default                 $24
                      (       cocovtio.d):00883         * NOTE: The following default settings are what the window was initialized
